                                                                    "text": "So you are willing to help, then? Many thanks to you!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "230250524",
                                                                    "speaker": "Farghani",
                                                                    "text": "Actually, I have ordered a customized set of beacons that will automatically collect the raw data necessary to support my deductions."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "230250525",
                                                                    "speaker": "Farghani",
                                                                    "text": "They need to be set up on high places such as cliffs and mountaintops for the raw data to stay free of the possible effects of terrains."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "230250526",
                                                                    "speaker": "Farghani",
                                                                    "text": "But as you can see, I'm not much of a climber...",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "230250527",
                                                                            "text": "Leave it to me.",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "230250528",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Farghani",
                                                                                    "text": "Thank you! The sampling sites are nearby. Just let me know when you're done."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "230250529",
                                                                            "text": "You didn't take terrain into account when placing your order?",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "230250530",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Farghani",
                                                                                    "text": "Ahem... The sensitivity of the instrument was a priority, so the range of applications was naturally sacrificed..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "230250531",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Farghani",
                                                                                    "text": "After all, the calculations could veer far off the mark even if we make only a small mistake. Anyways, I'm counting on you."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "230250515",
                                                            "text": "Good luck. See you.",
                                                            "response": [
